        "### Confusion Matrix for Top 5 Common POS Tags\n",
        "\n",
        "As specified in the deliverables, we will now generate a confusion matrix for the top 5 most common POS tags to analyze specific misclassification patterns."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 702
