        "## Part D: Baseline Comparison\n",
        "\n",
        "In this section, we will load a pre-trained, state-of-the-art POS tagger (NLTK's `PerceptronTagger`) and evaluate its performance on the same test set. This will serve as a baseline to compare against our custom HMM implementation."
      ]
